个样子……！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47814D90D25DBCCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028428017:1":{"text":"对不起，请原谅我……请原谅我！！","source_cn":"对不起，请原谅我……请原谅我！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214B2A8FEA6274C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1028428017":{"text":"对不起，请原谅我……请原谅我！！","source_cn":"对不起，请原谅我……请原谅我！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214B2A8FEA6274C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028428018:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>——我的主人都这么说了，那一定没问题！请放心吧。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x01B1F01CD2E18B54","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>——我的主人都这么说了，那一定没问题！请放心吧。","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>——我的主人都这么说了，那一定没问题！请放心吧。","variant_male_record_index":"111816","variant_female_record_index":"111817","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028428019:1":{"text":"只要没有人为推动，情况就不会继续恶化，丛林旺盛的生命力，再加上<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的魔法，足以净化那些腐化！","source_cn":"只要没有人为推动，情况就不会继续恶化，丛林旺盛的生命力...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x39272D940E47BD20","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"只要没有人为推动，情况就不会继续恶化，丛林旺盛的生命力，再加上<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的魔法，足以净化那些腐化